6. OWNER PAYMENT API
==================================================

Base paths:
/api/owner/payments
/api/owner/orders/{orderId}/payment-quote

Role:
OWNER / ADMIN

Important security rule:
Owners can create payments and cancel their own pending payments.
Owners cannot mark their own payments as SUCCEEDED.
Successful payment confirmation must be performed by STAFF or ADMIN.

