19. RECOMMENDED FRONTEND FLOWS
==================================================

Owner data retrieval flow:

1. Owner login
POST /api/auth/login

2. Submit device
POST /api/owner/devices

3. Create data retrieval order
POST /api/owner/devices/{deviceId}/orders/data-retrieval

4. Get payment quote
GET /api/owner/orders/{orderId}/payment-quote

5. Create sandbox payment
POST /api/owner/payments

6. Staff or Admin confirms payment
POST /api/staff/payments/{paymentId}/capture
or
POST /api/admin/payments/{paymentId}/capture

7. Owner gets secure link
GET /api/owner/orders/{orderId}/secure-link


Staff device processing flow:

1. View unknown queue
GET /api/staff/devices/unknown

2. View classification result
GET /api/staff/devices/{id}/classification-result

3. Update follow-up if needed
PATCH /api/staff/devices/{id}/follow-up

4. Reclassify device
POST /api/staff/devices/{id}/reclassify

5. Publish or hide device
POST /api/staff/devices/{id}/publish
POST /api/staff/devices/{id}/hide


Payment security flow:

Owner can:
- create payment
- view own payment
- cancel own pending payment

Owner cannot:
- mark payment as SUCCEEDED
- capture own payment as successful

Staff/Admin must:
- confirm payment success through capture endpoint

Successful payment confirmation endpoints:
POST /api/staff/payments/{paymentId}/capture
POST /api/admin/payments/{paymentId}/capture